{"type":"text","timestamp":1794565926524,"sessionID":"ses_e2b8c79dbfferd3LSls9Fjr4ae","part":{"id":"prt_1d476de3c002nPLQRHNzeXydGw","sessionID":"ses_e2b8c79dbfferd3LSls9Fjr4ae","messageID":"msg_1d476c40500192K2Q4W51Q1GrJ","type":"text","text":"T036 is done. I added one case to `T` and `VT` reports 0 failed.\n\n**File written:** `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts`\n\nThe new case is `leaves a loop that never initialised out of the unsafe runs with no changed path`. It reuses the neighbouring `loadableSession` and `summarize` helpers, writes into `specs/x/review/notes.md` without acquiring the lock, uses the `g2-deep-review-typed` row with `changedPaths: []` and expects `unsafe: 1` plus `unsafeNoChangedPath: 0`. It sits directly after the `counts an unsafe run whose line lists no changed path` case. No other file was changed and `tasks.md` was not ticked.\n\n**Verify output** (`VT`, run from `$ADV`):\n```\n RUN  v4.1.12 /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  60 passed (60)\n```\nA targeted run of the new case alone gave `1 passed | 59 skipped (60)`. The file now holds one more `it(` than it did before my edit.\n\n**The guard the case pins:** `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1316`\n\n```js\nif (result.unsafe && !result.wrote && result.loop !== false) tally.unsafeNoChangedPath += 1;\n```\n\nThe new run line is unsafe through `unsafe: start.unsafe || loop === false` and leaves `wrote` false because `changedPaths` is empty. If the `result.loop !== false` conjunct were absent, the count would rise to 1 and the new `unsafeNoChangedPath: 0` assertion would fail.\n\nNote: the working tree already held other workers' uncommitted edits in this file, including the adjacent no-changed-path case and a `deliveryUnknown` expectation. I left those untouched, and my edit only added the one new case.\n\nNothing is blocked on the operator.","time":{"start":1794565922364,"end":1794565926524}}}
